{"seq":2,"slug":"dml-advanced","title":"DML 进阶操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/dml-advanced","wordCount":857,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"dml-进阶操作\">DML 进阶操作</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据操作语言（DML）的进阶用法远超基础的 INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE。批量操作、UPSERT、RETURNING 子句、多表更新等高级特性是构建高效数据处理流程的关键。掌握这些进阶操作可以将原本需要应用层多次往返的逻辑压缩为单条 SQL，大幅提升性能和一致性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[DML 进阶] --&gt; B[批量操作]&#10;    A --&gt; C[UPSERT]&#10;    A --&gt; D[RETURNING]&#10;    A --&gt; E[多表操作]&#10;&#10;    B --&gt; B1[批量 INSERT]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[INSERT ... SELECT]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[COPY 命令]&#10;&#10;    C --&gt; C1[ON CONFLICT - PostgreSQL]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[ON DUPLICATE KEY - MySQL]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[MERGE - SQL 标准]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt; D1[INSERT RETURNING]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[UPDATE RETURNING]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[DELETE RETURNING]&#10;&#10;    E --&gt; E1[UPDATE ... FROM]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[DELETE ... USING]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[CTE + DML]\">graph TD\n    A[DML 进阶] --&gt; B[批量操作]\n    A --&gt; C[UPSERT]\n    A --&gt; D[RETURNING]\n    A --&gt; E[多表操作]\n\n    B --&gt; B1[批量 INSERT]\n    B --&gt; B2[INSERT ... SELECT]\n    B --&gt; B3[COPY 命令]\n\n    C --&gt; C1[ON CONFLICT - PostgreSQL]\n    C --&gt; C2[ON DUPLICATE KEY - MySQL]\n    C --&gt; C3[MERGE - SQL 标准]\n\n    D --&gt; D1[INSERT RETURNING]\n    D --&gt; D2[UPDATE RETURNING]\n    D --&gt; D3[DELETE RETURNING]\n\n    E --&gt; E1[UPDATE ... FROM]\n    E --&gt; E2[DELETE ... USING]\n    E --&gt; E3[CTE + DML]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>DML 特性</th>\n<th>PostgreSQL</th>\n<th>MySQL</th>\n<th>SQL Server</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UPSERT</td>\n<td>ON CONFLICT</td>\n<td>ON DUPLICATE KEY</td>\n<td>MERGE</td>\n<td>幂等写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RETURNING</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>OUTPUT</td>\n<td>获取生成值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量 INSERT</td>\n<td>VALUES 多行</td>\n<td>VALUES 多行</td>\n<td>VALUES 多行</td>\n<td>批量导入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CTE + DML</td>\n<td>完整支持</td>\n<td>MySQL 8.0+</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>复杂数据流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UPDATE FROM</td>\n<td>UPDATE ... FROM</td>\n<td>UPDATE ... JOIN</td>\n<td>UPDATE ... FROM</td>\n<td>多表关联更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"批量操作与性能\">批量操作与性能</h2><p>批量操作是提升写入性能的基本手段。逐行 INSERT 的网络往返开销远大于批量操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const batchOperations = `&#10;-- 单行 INSERT（性能最差）&#10;INSERT INTO products (name, price) VALUES (&#39;商品A&#39;, 100);&#10;INSERT INTO products (name, price) VALUES (&#39;商品B&#39;, 200);&#10;&#10;-- 批量 INSERT（推荐，一次性插入多行）&#10;INSERT INTO products (name, price) VALUES&#10;    (&#39;商品A&#39;, 100),&#10;    (&#39;商品B&#39;, 200),&#10;    (&#39;商品C&#39;, 300),&#10;    (&#39;商品D&#39;, 400);&#10;&#10;-- INSERT ... SELECT（从查询结果批量插入）&#10;INSERT INTO product_archive (product_id, name, price, archived_at)&#10;SELECT product_id, name, price, NOW()&#10;FROM products&#10;WHERE status = &#39;discontinued&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- COPY 命令（PostgreSQL 最快的批量加载方式）&#10;COPY products (name, price, category_id) &#10;FROM &#39;/tmp/products.csv&#39; &#10;WITH (FORMAT csv, HEADER true, DELIMITER &#39;,&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 应用层批量插入最佳实践&#10;-- 每批 1000-5000 行，太大可能导致内存问题和长事务&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> batchOperations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 单行 INSERT（性能最差）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO products (name, price) VALUES ('商品A', 100);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO products (name, price) VALUES ('商品B', 200);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 批量 INSERT（推荐，一次性插入多行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO products (name, price) VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ('商品A', 100),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ('商品B', 200),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ('商品C', 300),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    ('商品D', 400);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- INSERT ... SELECT（从查询结果批量插入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO product_archive (product_id, name, price, archived_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT product_id, name, price, NOW()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE status = 'discontinued';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- COPY 命令（PostgreSQL 最快的批量加载方式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">COPY products (name, price, category_id) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM '/tmp/products.csv' </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH (FORMAT csv, HEADER true, DELIMITER ',');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 应用层批量插入最佳实践</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 每批 1000-5000 行，太大可能导致内存问题和长事务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>写入方式</th>\n<th>每秒行数（估算）</th>\n<th>网络往返</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逐行 INSERT</td>\n<td>数百</td>\n<td>N 次</td>\n<td>调试、少量数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量 VALUES</td>\n<td>数千-数万</td>\n<td>1 次</td>\n<td>应用层批量写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INSERT SELECT</td>\n<td>数万-数十万</td>\n<td>1 次</td>\n<td>数据迁移/归档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>COPY</td>\n<td>数十万-百万</td>\n<td>流式传输</td>\n<td>ETL、大批量加载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"upsert-插入或更新\">UPSERT（插入或更新）</h2><p>UPSERT 是&quot;如果不存在则插入，如果已存在则更新&quot;的原子操作。这消除了应用层&quot;先查询再决定插入还是更新&quot;的竞态条件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const upsertPatterns = `&#10;-- PostgreSQL ON CONFLICT&#10;INSERT INTO user_settings (user_id, setting_key, setting_value)&#10;VALUES (1, &#39;theme&#39;, &#39;dark&#39;)&#10;ON CONFLICT (user_id, setting_key) &#10;DO UPDATE SET &#10;    setting_value = EXCLUDED.setting_value,&#10;    updated_at = NOW();&#10;&#10;-- ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING（忽略冲突，幂等插入）&#10;INSERT INTO unique_events (event_id, event_type, created_at)&#10;VALUES (&#39;evt_123&#39;, &#39;click&#39;, NOW())&#10;ON CONFLICT (event_id) DO NOTHING;&#10;&#10;-- 条件性 UPSERT（只在特定条件下更新）&#10;INSERT INTO product_prices (product_id, price, updated_at)&#10;VALUES (1, 299, NOW())&#10;ON CONFLICT (product_id)&#10;DO UPDATE SET &#10;    price = EXCLUDED.price,&#10;    updated_at = NOW()&#10;WHERE product_prices.price &lt;&gt; EXCLUDED.price;&#10;&#10;-- 批量 UPSERT&#10;INSERT INTO inventory (product_id, warehouse_id, quantity)&#10;VALUES &#10;    (1, &#39;WH001&#39;, 100),&#10;    (2, &#39;WH001&#39;, 200),&#10;    (3, &#39;WH002&#39;, 50)&#10;ON CONFLICT (product_id, warehouse_id)&#10;DO UPDATE SET &#10;    quantity = EXCLUDED.quantity,&#10;    updated_at = NOW();&#10;&#10;-- MySQL ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE&#10;-- INSERT INTO user_settings (user_id, setting_key, setting_value)&#10;-- VALUES (1, &#39;theme&#39;, &#39;dark&#39;)&#10;-- ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE setting_value = VALUES(setting_value);&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> upsertPatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- PostgreSQL ON CONFLICT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO user_settings (user_id, setting_key, setting_value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VALUES (1, 'theme', 'dark')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ON CONFLICT (user_id, setting_key) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DO UPDATE SET </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    setting_value = EXCLUDED.setting_value,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    updated_at = NOW();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING（忽略冲突，幂等插入）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO unique_events (event_id, event_type, created_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VALUES ('evt_123', 'click', NOW())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ON CONFLICT (event_id) DO NOTHING;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 条件性 UPSERT（只在特定条件下更新）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO product_prices (product_id, price, updated_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VALUES (1, 299, NOW())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ON CONFLICT (product_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DO UPDATE SET </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    price = EXCLUDED.price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    updated_at = NOW()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE product_prices.price &#x3C;> EXCLUDED.price;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 批量 UPSERT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO inventory (product_id, warehouse_id, quantity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VALUES </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (1, 'WH001', 100),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (2, 'WH001', 200),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (3, 'WH002', 50)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ON CONFLICT (product_id, warehouse_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DO UPDATE SET </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    quantity = EXCLUDED.quantity,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    updated_at = NOW();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- MySQL ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- INSERT INTO user_settings (user_id, setting_key, setting_value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- VALUES (1, 'theme', 'dark')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE setting_value = VALUES(setting_value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>UPSERT 的关键是冲突目标的选择——必须是唯一索引或主键。EXCLUDED 关键字引用试图插入的新值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"returning-子句\">RETURNING 子句</h2><p>RETURNING 子句使 INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE 在执行操作的同时返回受影响的行数据，避免了额外的 SELECT 查询。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const returningClause = `&#10;-- INSERT RETURNING：获取自动生成的 ID 和默认值&#10;INSERT INTO orders (user_id, amount)&#10;VALUES (1, 500)&#10;RETURNING order_id, created_at;&#10;&#10;-- 批量 INSERT RETURNING&#10;INSERT INTO notifications (user_id, message)&#10;SELECT user_id, &#39;系统升级通知&#39;&#10;FROM users WHERE status = 1&#10;RETURNING notification_id, user_id;&#10;&#10;-- UPDATE RETURNING：获取更新前后的值&#10;UPDATE products&#10;SET price = price * 0.9&#10;WHERE category_id = 5&#10;RETURNING product_id, name, price AS new_price;&#10;&#10;-- DELETE RETURNING：获取被删除的数据&#10;DELETE FROM expired_sessions&#10;WHERE expires_at &lt; NOW()&#10;RETURNING session_id, user_id;&#10;&#10;-- CTE + RETURNING：链式操作&#10;WITH deleted AS (&#10;    DELETE FROM orders &#10;    WHERE status = &#39;cancelled&#39; AND created_at &lt; &#39;2023-01-01&#39;&#10;    RETURNING *&#10;)&#10;INSERT INTO order_archive SELECT * FROM deleted;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> returningClause</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- INSERT RETURNING：获取自动生成的 ID 和默认值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO orders (user_id, amount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VALUES (1, 500)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RETURNING order_id, created_at;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 批量 INSERT RETURNING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO notifications (user_id, message)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT user_id, '系统升级通知'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM users WHERE status = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RETURNING notification_id, user_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- UPDATE RETURNING：获取更新前后的值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UPDATE products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SET price = price * 0.9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE category_id = 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RETURNING product_id, name, price AS new_price;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- DELETE RETURNING：获取被删除的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DELETE FROM expired_sessions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE expires_at &#x3C; NOW()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RETURNING session_id, user_id;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- CTE + RETURNING：链式操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH deleted AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    DELETE FROM orders </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE status = 'cancelled' AND created_at &#x3C; '2023-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    RETURNING *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO order_archive SELECT * FROM deleted;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>RETURNING 在应用层开发中极为有用。例如创建订单后需要返回订单 ID 给前端，传统做法需要 INSERT + SELECT 两步，用 RETURNING 一步完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cte-与-dml-组合\">CTE 与 DML 组合</h2><p>PostgreSQL 支持在 CTE 中使用 DML 语句（可写 CTE），实现复杂的多步数据操作流水线。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const writableCTE = `&#10;-- 归档 + 删除：一步完成&#10;WITH archived AS (&#10;    DELETE FROM events &#10;    WHERE created_at &lt; &#39;2023-01-01&#39;&#10;    RETURNING *&#10;)&#10;INSERT INTO events_archive SELECT * FROM archived;&#10;&#10;-- 更新 + 插入日志&#10;WITH updated AS (&#10;    UPDATE orders &#10;    SET status = &#39;shipped&#39;, shipped_at = NOW()&#10;    WHERE order_id = 12345&#10;    RETURNING order_id, user_id, status, shipped_at&#10;)&#10;INSERT INTO order_status_log (order_id, user_id, new_status, changed_at)&#10;SELECT order_id, user_id, status, shipped_at FROM updated;&#10;&#10;-- 条件更新 + 汇总&#10;WITH price_updates AS (&#10;    UPDATE products&#10;    SET price = price * 1.1&#10;    WHERE category_id = 5 AND last_update &lt; &#39;2024-01-01&#39;&#10;    RETURNING product_id, price&#10;)&#10;SELECT COUNT(*) AS updated_count, AVG(price) AS new_avg_price&#10;FROM price_updates;&#10;&#10;-- 多表关联更新&#10;UPDATE orders o&#10;SET total_amount = sub.calc_total&#10;FROM (&#10;    SELECT order_id, SUM(quantity * unit_price) AS calc_total&#10;    FROM order_items&#10;    GROUP BY order_id&#10;) sub&#10;WHERE o.order_id = sub.order_id&#10;  AND o.total_amount &lt;&gt; sub.calc_total;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> writableCTE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 归档 + 删除：一步完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH archived AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    DELETE FROM events </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE created_at &#x3C; '2023-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    RETURNING *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO events_archive SELECT * FROM archived;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 更新 + 插入日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH updated AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    UPDATE orders </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SET status = 'shipped', shipped_at = NOW()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE order_id = 12345</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    RETURNING order_id, user_id, status, shipped_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">INSERT INTO order_status_log (order_id, user_id, new_status, changed_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT order_id, user_id, status, shipped_at FROM updated;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 条件更新 + 汇总</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WITH price_updates AS (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    UPDATE products</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SET price = price * 1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE category_id = 5 AND last_update &#x3C; '2024-01-01'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    RETURNING product_id, price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT COUNT(*) AS updated_count, AVG(price) AS new_avg_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM price_updates;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 多表关联更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UPDATE orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SET total_amount = sub.calc_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    SELECT order_id, SUM(quantity * unit_price) AS calc_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    FROM order_items</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    GROUP BY order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) sub</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE o.order_id = sub.order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  AND o.total_amount &#x3C;> sub.calc_total;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>可写 CTE 的执行是原子的——所有 CTE 中的 DML 和最终语句在同一个事务中执行。如果任何步骤失败，整个操作回滚。这保证了复杂数据操作的一致性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"软删除与数据生命周期\">软删除与数据生命周期</h2><p>软删除是在不实际删除数据的情况下标记数据为&quot;已删除&quot;，常用于需要恢复能力或审计追踪的场景。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const softDeletePatterns = `&#10;-- 软删除：标记而非物理删除&#10;UPDATE products &#10;SET deleted_at = NOW() &#10;WHERE product_id = 123;&#10;&#10;-- 查询时排除已删除记录（需要每个查询都加条件）&#10;SELECT * FROM products WHERE deleted_at IS NULL;&#10;&#10;-- 更好的方案：使用视图封装&#10;CREATE VIEW active_products AS&#10;SELECT * FROM products WHERE deleted_at IS NULL;&#10;&#10;-- 配合部分索引优化查询&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_active_products ON products(category_id) &#10;    WHERE deleted_at IS NULL;&#10;&#10;-- 定期清理软删除数据（物理删除超过保留期的记录）&#10;DELETE FROM products &#10;WHERE deleted_at IS NOT NULL &#10;  AND deleted_at &lt; NOW() - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> softDeletePatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 软删除：标记而非物理删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">UPDATE products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SET deleted_at = NOW() </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE product_id = 123;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 查询时排除已删除记录（需要每个查询都加条件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products WHERE deleted_at IS NULL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 更好的方案：使用视图封装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE VIEW active_products AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT * FROM products WHERE deleted_at IS NULL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 配合部分索引优化查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CREATE INDEX idx_active_products ON products(category_id) </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    WHERE deleted_at IS NULL;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- 定期清理软删除数据（物理删除超过保留期的记录）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DELETE FROM products </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WHERE deleted_at IS NOT NULL </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  AND deleted_at &#x3C; NOW() - INTERVAL '90 days';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>删除策略</th>\n<th>可恢复</th>\n<th>查询复杂度</th>\n<th>存储影响</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬删除</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无额外条件</td>\n<td>释放空间</td>\n<td>无审计需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软删除</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>每个查询加条件</td>\n<td>持续增长</td>\n<td>需要恢复和审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归档删除</td>\n<td>是（归档表）</td>\n<td>无额外条件</td>\n<td>主表精简</td>\n<td>历史数据保留</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>批量 INSERT 比逐行 INSERT 性能高数十倍，COPY 是 PostgreSQL 最快的批量加载方式</li>\n<li>UPSERT（ON CONFLICT）提供原子的&quot;存在则更新，不存在则插入&quot;语义，消除竞态条件</li>\n<li>RETURNING 子句使 DML 语句同时返回受影响的行数据，避免额外的 SELECT 查询</li>\n<li>可写 CTE 在 PostgreSQL 中支持复杂的多步 DML 流水线，所有操作在同一事务中原子执行</li>\n<li>多表关联更新使用 UPDATE ... FROM 语法，避免应用层多次往返</li>\n<li>软删除通过 deleted_at 列标记代替物理删除，配合视图和部分索引保持查询效率</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"DML 进阶操作","id":"dml-进阶操作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"批量操作与性能","id":"批量操作与性能"},{"level":2,"text":"UPSERT（插入或更新）","id":"upsert-插入或更新"},{"level":2,"text":"RETURNING 子句","id":"returning-子句"},{"level":2,"text":"CTE 与 DML 组合","id":"cte-与-dml-组合"},{"level":2,"text":"软删除与数据生命周期","id":"软删除与数据生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"聚合分析模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/aggregation-patterns"},"next":{"title":"JSON 与半结构化数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/json-semi-structured"}}